	(descr "Harwin Datamate J-Tek M80-5002042, 20 contacts (10+10), 2.00mm pitch, DIL dual row male vertical throughboard connector, 3.3A per contact, 800V working, 25mOhm max, 500 mating cycles, -55 to +125C, 100G shock, low outgassing. Contact holes 0.90mm on a 2.00mm pitch with 2.00mm row spacing; body 30.00mm long, 5.55mm above the PCB, 3.30mm PC tails. M2 internal-thread jackscrews at x +/-12.50mm, all above the seating plane, so no mounting holes are required. Contact numbering is row-wise per C005XX Appendix 1; those diagrams look onto the male contact face and so mirror in PCB top view - confirm which row carries contact 1 against the polarising key before wiring")
